    "updated_at": "2023-05-04T15:49:09Z",
    "body": "> @nt1m I called it with is modal set to true because @scottaohara said that this focusing behavior is better here: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1430405#c3\r\n> \r\n> He also said that maybe we should remove the modal parameter from that algorithm though and always do the modal logic\r\n\r\nRemoving the modal parameter completely seems like a reasonable way forward, however, reporting popovers as modal is wrong by definition.",
